+ * <ul>
+ * <li>Tests verify Simple Vector Store SpEL syntax: {@code '...'}</li>
+ * <li>SpEL-specific escaping: single quotes doubled ('')</li>
+ * <li>Tests cover the most critical SpEL injection scenarios</li>
+ * </ul>
