+ * <p>
+ * <b>Test Strategy:</b>
+ * <ul>
+ * <li>Tests verify MariaDB SQL syntax: {@code '...'}</li>
+ * <li>SQL-specific escaping: single quotes doubled (''), backslashes escaped</li>
+ * <li>Tests cover the most critical SQL injection scenarios</li>
